          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your size increases due to a polymorph effect.</p><hr /><p>The physical growth of your transformation is a spectacle that shakes foes to their core. Each enemy smaller than your new size within 30 feet of you must attempt a @Check[will|against:class-spell|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened] save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher.</p><hr /><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}, and you can push it up to 10 feet from you. This is forced movement.</p>"
          },
